WEBVTT

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:31.266
I realized that our behavior
and consumption habits

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:34.626
have contributed
in environmental degradation

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:37.286
and have resulted in global warming.

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:41.660
However, I believe
that people grow spiritually

00:02:41.684 --> 00:02:44.792
through a strong relationship
with the earth.

00:02:44.816 --> 00:02:48.246
Being born in the rain forest
region of Sumatra,

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:51.556
I believe in the power of our forests

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:55.506
as the natural solution
to our climate crisis

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:59.026
by giving indigenous peoples
and traditional communities

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:03.874
more rights to protect and manage
the forests where they live.